    "Preparing the file": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Förbereder filen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every layer is written as it is: %lld layers and groups.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varje lager skrivs som det är: %lld lager och grupper."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld layers and groups are written. These things are not written as they are:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld lager och grupper skrivs. Det här skrivs inte som det är:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text, smart objects and effects can't be edited as such in the file. Glimmer has read its own Photoshop files back and macOS shows their picture; the layers have not been tried in Photoshop.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text, smarta objekt och effekter går inte att redigera som sådana i filen. Glimmer har läst tillbaka sina egna Photoshop-filer och macOS visar deras bild; lagren har inte provats i Photoshop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spara…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photoshop File…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
